('195', '1', 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'property', '{\"name\":\"Green Alliance Enterprises \\u2013 A New Business Opportunity in Ahmed Pur East\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\RealEstate\\\\Models\\\\Property\",\"slug\":\"green-alliance-enterprises-a-new-business-opportunity-in-ahmed-pur-east\",\"slug_id\":\"63\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"type\":\"sale\",\"description\":\"Green Alliance Enterprises is introducing a modern fruit and vegetable market designed to create new business opportunities for traders, commission agents, wholesalers, retailers, and investors. Located in Ahmed Pur East, this developing market is planned to serve not only the local area but also surrounding business communities including Rahim Yar Khan and Liaqat Pur.\",\"is_featured\":\"1\",\"featured_priority\":\"0\",\"content\":\"<p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>The purpose of this market is simple: to create an organized, spacious, and business-friendly environment where fresh produce trading can take place smoothly and efficiently. Every morning, large wholesalers and suppliers can bring fruits and vegetables to the market, while commission agents and small retailers can purchase stock in a well-managed setting. This model creates value for all levels of the supply chain and helps build a strong commercial ecosystem.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>One of the biggest strengths of Green Alliance Enterprises is its focus on convenience and infrastructure. The market is being developed with wide internal roads, open surroundings, and dedicated spaces that support the movement of trucks, loading and unloading, and daily wholesale activity. Large covered sheds are planned for wholesalers, commission agents, and auction-related trading, helping businesses operate more comfortably and professionally.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>For entrepreneurs and investors, Green Alliance Enterprises also offers commercial shop opportunities. Whether someone wants to establish a fruit business, vegetable trade office, seed and pesticide outlet, grocery store, packaging unit, tea stall, transport office, or other support business, the market provides a promising location to start and grow. Small and large shops are available to suit different business needs.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>The project becomes even more attractive because of its accessible ownership plan. Businesses can secure a shop with a <strong>25% down payment<\\/strong>, receive possession, and continue with an easy <strong>3-year installment plan<\\/strong>. This makes it easier for new business owners as well as experienced traders from <strong>Rahim Yar Khan, Liaqat Pur, and Ahmed Pur East<\\/strong> to enter the market without facing the pressure of full upfront payment.<\\/span><\\/p><p><span>Green Alliance Enterprises is not just developing a market; it is building a commercial destination for the future. For anyone looking to grow in the fruit and vegetable trade or invest in a high-potential business location, this is an opportunity worth exploring.<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"images\":[null,\"gemini-generated-image-rubqierubqierubq-1.jpg\",\"gemini-generated-image-rubqierubqierubq.jpg\"],\"country_id\":null,\"state_id\":null,\"city_id\":null,\"location\":\"456 Maple Avenue, Downtown District\",\"latitude\":\"43.5373\",\"longitude\":\"-76.6804\",\"number_bedroom\":\"9\",\"number_bathroom\":\"3\",\"number_floor\":\"70\",\"square\":\"290\",\"price\":\"148900\",\"currency_id\":\"1\",\"period\":\"month\",\"never_expired\":\"1\",\"auto_renew\":\"0\",\"private_notes\":null,\"floor_plans\":\"[]\",\"facilities\":{\"01\":{\"id\":\"1\",\"distance\":\"1km\"},\"11\":{\"id\":\"2\",\"distance\":\"0km\"},\"21\":{\"id\":\"4\",\"distance\":\"0km\"},\"31\":{\"id\":\"7\",\"distance\":\"4km\"},\"41\":{\"id\":\"8\",\"distance\":\"0.5km\"},\"51\":{\"id\":\"10\",\"distance\":\"0.5km\"},\"61\":{\"id\":\"11\",\"distance\":\"0km\"}},\"features\":[\"8\",\"9\",\"10\",\"