\/li><li><span>Spacious and open market surroundings<\\/span><\\/li><li><span>Large covered trading sheds<\\/span><\\/li><li><span>Dedicated areas for wholesalers and commission agents<\\/span><\\/li><li><span>Space for fruit and vegetable auction activity<\\/span><\\/li><li><span>Commercial shop opportunities<\\/span><\\/li><li><span>Electricity facilities for businesses<\\/span><\\/li><li><span>Convenient loading and unloading environment<\\/span><\\/li><\\/ul><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>These facilities can help make daily trading more organized for suppliers, commission agents and retailers.<\\/span><\\/p><h2><span>Opportunities for Commission Agents and Wholesalers<\\/span><\\/h2><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Commission agents, traditionally known as <strong>arhtis<\\/strong>, play an important role in Pakistan\'s agricultural trading system.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Green Alliance Enterprises provides opportunities for commission agents who want to establish their presence in a developing wholesale market.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Large suppliers can bring produce into the market, while commission agents can facilitate transactions between wholesalers and smaller retailers, shopkeepers and street vendors.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>This creates a complete trading chain within one commercial environment.<\\/span><\\/p><h2><span>Commercial Shops for Different Businesses<\\/span><\\/h2><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>A busy fruit and vegetable market also creates demand for many supporting businesses.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Commercial shops at Green Alliance Enterprises can be suitable for:<\\/span><\\/p><h3><span>Agriculture-Related Businesses<\\/span><\\/h3><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Seed stores, fertilizer businesses, agricultural spray suppliers, pesticide shops and farming-input businesses can benefit from being close to traders and growers.<\\/span><\\/p><h3><span>Packaging and Produce Support Businesses<\\/span><\\/h3><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Businesses selling vegetable crates, fruit boxes, sacks, packaging materials and related supplies can serve wholesalers and retailers directly inside the market.<\\/span><\\/p><h3><span>Daily-Use Businesses<\\/span><\\/h3><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Grocery shops, general stores, tea points, restaurants and other convenience businesses can serve traders, drivers, workers and customers visiting the market daily.<\\/span><\\/p><h3><span>Transport and Vehicle Services<\\/span><\\/h3><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>With trucks and commercial vehicles regularly visiting a wholesale market, businesses related to transportation, logistics, tyre repair, mechanical services and loading operations may also find opportunities.<\\/span><\\/p><h2><span>Commercial Shops With Flexible Payment Options<\\/span><\\/h2><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Green Alliance Enterprises is offering <strong>small and large commercial shops<\\/strong> for businesses and investors.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Buyers can start with a <strong>25% down payment<\\/strong>, receive possession according to the project\'s terms and pay the remaining amount through an easy <strong>3-year installment plan<\\/strong>.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>This payment structure can make commercial ownership more accessible for entrepreneurs who want to establish a business without paying the full amount upfront.<\\/span><\\/p><h2><span>Connecting Rahim Yar Khan, Liaqat Pur and Ahmed Pur East<\\/span><\\/h2><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Green Alliance Enterprises has the potential to serve a wider regional trading community rather than only one local market.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Businesses and produce traders operating between <strong>Rahim Yar Khan, Liaqat Pur and Ahmed Pur East<\\/str