('243', '1', 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'page', '{\"name\":\"Contact Us\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Page\\\\Models\\\\Page\",\"slug\":\"contact-us\",\"slug_id\":\"124\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":null,\"content\":\"<shortcode>[contact-form display_fields=\\\"phone,email,subject,address\\\" mandatory_fields=\\\"email\\\" style=\\\"1\\\" title=\\\"Drop Us A Line\\\" description=\\\"Feel free to connect with us through our online channels for updates, news, and more.\\\" show_information_box=\\\"1\\\" contact_title=\\\"Contact Us\\\" quantity=\\\"3\\\" label_1=\\\"Address:\\\" content_1=\\\"101 E 129th St, East Chicago, IN 46312 United States\\\" label_2=\\\"Information:\\\" content_2=\\\"1-333-345-6868 hi.themesflat@gmail.com\\\" label_3=\\\"Open time:\\\" content_3=\\\"Monday - Friday: 08:00 - 20:00 Saturday - Sunday: 10:00 - 18:00\\\" show_social_links=\\\"1\\\"][\\/contact-form]<\\/shortcode><shortcode>[google-map]101 E 129th St, East Chicago, IN 46312 United States[\\/google-map]<\\/shortcode>\",\"seo_meta\":{\"seo_title\":null,\"seo_description\":null,\"index\":\"index\"},\"seo_meta_image\":null,\"submitter\":\"apply\",\"status\":\"published\",\"template\":\"default\",\"image\":\"gemini-generated-image-y2bj0ty2bj0ty2bj.jpg\",\"breadcrumb\":\"yes\",\"breadcrumb_background_color\":\"transparent\",\"breadcrumb_text_color\":\"transparent\",\"breadcrumb_background_image\":null}', 'updated', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/151.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', '127.0.0.1', '1', 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', '7', 'Contact Us', 'primary', '2026-08-16 15:51:51', '2026-08-16 15:51:51'),
('244', '1', 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'post', '{\"name\":\"Inside Green Alliance Enterprises: 8 Facilities Built for Modern Wholesale Trade\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Blog\\\\Models\\\\Post\",\"slug\":\"inside-green-alliance-enterprises-8-facilities-built-for-modern-wholesale-trade\",\"slug_id\":\"0\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"Explore the modern facilities at Green Alliance Enterprises in Ahmedpur East, including wide roads, auction platforms, electricity, banking, CCTV, mosque, sewerage and secure boundary walls.\",\"is_featured\":\"1\",\"content\":\"<p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Green Alliance Enterprises is developing a new standard for wholesale agricultural trade in <strong>Ahmedpur East<\\/strong>. Designed as the <strong>largest fruit and vegetable market in Ahmedpur East<\\/strong>, the project focuses not only on trading space but also on the infrastructure and facilities that wholesalers, commission agents, retailers, transporters and other businesses need every day.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>A successful fruit and vegetable market must be accessible, secure, organized and capable of handling heavy commercial activity. From trucks arriving early in the morning to produce auctions, retail purchasing and supporting businesses, every part of the market needs to work efficiently.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>That is why <strong>Green Alliance Enterprises<\\/strong> has been planned as a complete commercial environment rather than simply a collection of shops.<\\/span><\\/p><h2><span>A Wholesale Market Designed Around Real Business Needs<\\/span><\\/h2><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Fruit and vegetable trading involves constant movement.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Large wholesalers bring produce into the market. Commission agents coordinate transactions. Retailers, shopkeepers and street vendors purchase stock. Trucks and pickups move in and out throughout the day.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Without proper infrastructure, this activity can quickly create congestion and inconvenience.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Green Alliance Enterprises addresses these challenges by providing a spacious and organized market environment with essential facilities for daily business operations.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Here are <strong>eight key facilities<\\/strong> that make the project stand out.<\\/span><\\/p><h2><span>1. Secure Boundary Wall for a Controlled Market Environment<\\/span><\\/h2><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Security is one of the first requirements of any major commercial development.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Green Alliance Enterprises features a <strong>proper boundary wall<\\/strong> surrounding the market, creating a clearly defined and controlled business environment.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>A secure boundary helps protect commercial areas while supporting better management of entry and exit points.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>For wholesalers and shop owners storing produce, equipment and other business assets, a well-defined market boundary provides an additional level of confidence.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>The boundary wall also contributes to the organized appearance of the overall project.<\\/span><\\/p><h2><span>2. Dedicated Mosque for Traders, Workers and Visitors<\\/span><\\/h2><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Wholesale markets often become active before sunrise and continue operating for many hours.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Traders, commission agents, transporters, workers and visitors may spend a significant part of their day inside the market.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>To provide greater convenience, Green Alliance Enterprises includes a <strong>dedicated mosque facility within the market environment<\\/strong>.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>This allows people working or visiting the mandi to offer prayers conveniently without having to leave their place of business.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Providing essential everyday facilities such as a mosque helps create a more complete and comfortable commercial destination.<\\/span><\\/p><h2><span>3. Wide Solid Roads and Street Lighting<\\/span><\\/h2><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>One of the biggest challenges in traditional wholesale markets is congestion.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Fruit and vegetable trading depends heavily on transportation, with large trucks, pickups and smaller commercial vehicles regularly entering the market.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Green Alliance Enterprises has been designed with <strong>wide, solid internal roads<\\/strong> to provide sufficient space for commercial traffic.<\\/span><\\/p><h3><span>Better Movement for Heavy Vehicles<\\/span><\\/h3><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>The wider road network can make it easier for:<\\/span><\\/p><ul data-spread=\\\"false\\\"><li><span>Large trucks carrying fresh produce<\\/span><\\/li><li><span>Pickups collecting wholesale purchases<\\/span><\\/li><li><span>Delivery vehicles<\\/span><\\/li><li><span>Retail buyers<\\/span><\\/li><li><span>Transport and logistics operators<\\/span><\\/li><\\/ul><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Efficient road access is especially important during peak trading hours when multiple suppliers and buyers arrive at the same time.<\\/span><\\/p><h3><span>Street Lights for Better Visibility<\\/span><\\/h3><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>The market also includes <strong>street lighting<\\/strong>, supporting better visibility during early-morning and evening operations.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Since fruit and vegetable wholesale trading often starts very early, proper lighting can make the environment more practical for traders, drivers and workers.<\\/span><\\/p><h2><span>4. Wide Auction Platform for Wholesale Trading<\\/span><\\/h2><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Auctions are at the heart of many fruit and vegetable wholesale markets.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Suppliers bring produce to the mandi, while commission agents, wholesalers and buyers negotiate and purchase products in bulk.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Green Alliance Enterprises provides a <strong>wide auction platform designed specifically for wholesale trading activities<\\/strong>.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>The additional space allows larger quantities of fruits and vegetables to be displayed while providing traders with sufficient room to conduct transactions.<\\/span><\\/p><h3><span>Supporting Commission Agents<\\/span><\\/h3><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Commission agents, commonly known as <strong>arhtis<\\/strong>, play an important role in connecting large suppliers with smaller retailers and buyers.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>A dedicated auction platform creates a more organized environment where agents can manage transactions and buyers can participate in wholesale trade efficiently.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>This can contribute to smoother daily market activity and better coordination between suppliers and buyers.<\\/span><\\/p><h2><span>5. Mega Sewerage System for a Cleaner Market<\\/span><\\/h2><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Proper drainage is particularly important in a fruit and vegetable market.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Produce markets require frequent cleaning, while water, organic waste and daily commercial activity create additional drainage requirements.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Green Alliance Enterprises includes a <strong>mega sewerage system<\\/strong> designed to support the scale of the market.<\\/span><\\/p><h3><span>Why Proper Sewerage Matters<\\/span><\\/h3><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>An effective sewerage and drainage system can help with:<\\/span><\\/p><ul data-spread=\\\"false\\\"><li><span>Faster removal of wastewater<\\/span><\\/li><li><span>Reduced water accumulation<\\/span><\\/li><li><span>Better market cleanliness<\\/span><\\/li><li><span>Improved hygiene<\\/span><\\/li><li><span>Easier maintenance<\\/span><\\/li><li><span>A more comfortable environment for businesses and visitors<\\/span><\\/li><\\/ul><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Good drainage infrastructure is not always visible, but it plays an essential role in maintaining a functional wholesale market over the long term.<\\/span><\\/p><h2><span>6. Electricity for Shops and Commercial Operations<\\/span><\\/h2><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Electricity is essential for almost every modern business.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Green Alliance Enterprises provides <strong>electricity facilities for commercial shops and market operations<\\/strong>, allowing different types of businesses to operate more effectively.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Electricity can support:<\\/span><\\/p><ul data-spread=\\\"false\\\"><li><span>Commission agent offices<\\/span><\\/li><li><span>Wholesale shops<\\/span><\\/li><li><span>Grocery stores<\\/span><\\/li><li><span>Agricultural input businesses<\\/span><\\/li><li><span>Food and tea outlets<\\/span><\\/li><li><span>Packaging businesses<\\/span><\\/li><li><span>Offices and service providers<\\/span><\\/li><li><span>Lighting and business equipment<\\/span><\\/li><\\/ul><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>This gives entrepreneurs the flexibility to establish businesses beyond traditional fruit and vegetable trading.<\\/span><\\/p><h2><span>7. Banking Facility for Convenient Business Transactions<\\/span><\\/h2><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Wholesale markets handle frequent and often high-volume financial transactions.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Suppliers need payments, commission agents manage accounts, retailers purchase stock and investors may need banking services during regular business hours.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Having a <strong>banking facility available within the market environment<\\/strong> can make financial transactions more convenient for traders and business owners.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Instead of travelling away from the market for routine banking needs, traders can access financial services closer to where they conduct their business.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>This can save time and improve the overall efficiency of daily trading activity.<\\/span><\\/p><h2><span>8. CCTV Surveillance for Additional Security<\\/span><\\/h2><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>A modern commercial market requires effective monitoring.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Green Alliance Enterprises includes <strong>CCTV surveillance<\\/strong> to support security throughout important areas of the development.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>CCTV monitoring can provide additional protection for:<\\/span><\\/p><ul data-spread=\\\"false\\\"><li><span>Commercial shops<\\/span><\\/li><li><span>Traders and customers<\\/span><\\/li><li><span>Market roads<\\/span><\\/li><li><span>Auction areas<\\/span><\\/li><li><span>Vehicles<\\/span><\\/li><li><span>Market property<\\/span><\\/li><\\/ul><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>When combined with the market\'s boundary wall and organized infrastructure, CCTV can help create a more secure and professionally managed environment.<\\/span><\\/p><h2><span>More Than a Traditional Fruit and Vegetable Mandi<\\/span><\\/h2><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>The vision behind Green Alliance Enterprises goes beyond creating another traditional mandi.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>The project is being developed as a <strong>complete wholesale and commercial business destination<\\/strong> where different parts of the agricultural supply chain can operate together.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Large wholesalers can bring produce into the market.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Commission agents can connect suppliers with buyers.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Retailers and street vendors can purchase stock.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Transport companies can move goods between cities.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Supporting businesses can provide products and services required by everyone visiting the market.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>This combination creates a broader commercial ecosystem.<\\/span><\\/p><h2><span>Business Opportunities Inside Green Alliance Enterprises<\\/span><\\/h2><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>The market is not limited to fruit and vegetable wholesalers.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>The regular movement of traders, drivers, retailers and agricultural customers creates opportunities for many supporting businesses.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Potential businesses may include:<\\/span><\\/p><h3><span>Agricultural Input Shops<\\/span><\\/h3><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Seed, fertilizer, pesticide, spray and farming-supply businesses can serve agricultural customers visiting the mandi.<\\/span><\\/p><h3><span>Packaging Suppliers<\\/span><\\/h3><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Crates, cartons, sacks and other packaging materials are regularly required for transporting fresh produce.<\\/span><\\/p><h3><span>Grocery and General Stores<\\/span><\\/h3><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Everyday products can serve traders, workers, drivers and customers spending time in the market.<\\/span><\\/p><h3><span>Restaurants and Tea Points<\\/span><\\/h3><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Early-morning trading creates demand for breakfast, tea, refreshments and meals.<\\/span><\\/p><h3><span>Transport and Logistics Businesses<\\/span><\\/h3><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Truck booking, delivery coordination, loading and logistics services can support the movement of produce.<\\/span><\\/p><h3><span>Vehicle Support Services<\\/span><\\/h3><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Tyre shops, puncture services, mechanical workshops and related businesses can serve commercial vehicles operating around the market.<\\/span><\\/p><h2><span>Built for Wholesalers and Commission Agents<\\/span><\\/h2><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Green Alliance Enterprises places particular importance on creating a suitable environment for wholesalers and commission agents.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>The combination of <strong>wide roads, auction platforms, electricity, security and spacious trading areas<\\/strong> is designed to support the daily requirements of serious commercial traders.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>For commission agents looking to establish themselves in a growing market, dedicated trading infrastructure can help create a professional base for their operations.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>For wholesalers, better vehicle access and auction space can make handling larger volumes of produce easier.<\\/span><\\/p><h2><span>A Modern Commercial Destination in Ahmedpur East<\\/span><\\/h2><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Location and infrastructure play a major role in the success of any commercial market.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>By developing a spacious wholesale market with essential facilities, Green Alliance Enterprises aims to create a strong trading destination for businesses in <strong>Ahmedpur East and surrounding areas<\\/strong>.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>The project combines traditional wholesale fruit and vegetable trading with modern commercial planning.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Instead of expecting businesses to adapt to an overcrowded environment, the market is being developed around the operational needs of traders.<\\/span><\\/p><h2><span>Why Businesses Should Consider Green Alliance Enterprises<\\/span><\\/h2><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>For traders and entrepreneurs, the value of a commercial market depends on what it can provide beyond a shop.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Green Alliance Enterprises brings together several important advantages:<\\/span><\\/p><ul data-spread=\\\"false\\\"><li><span>Secure boundary wall<\\/span><\\/li><li><span>Dedicated mosque<\\/span><\\/li><li><span>Wide solid internal roads<\\/span><\\/li><li><span>Street lighting<\\/span><\\/li><li><span>Spacious auction platform<\\/span><\\/li><li><span>Mega sewerage system<\\/span><\\/li><li><span>Electricity facilities<\\/span><\\/li><li><span>Banking services<\\/span><\\/li><li><span>CCTV surveillance<\\/span><\\/li><li><span>Commercial business opportunities<\\/span><\\/li><li><span>Infrastructure suitable for wholesalers and commission agents<\\/span><\\/li><\\/ul><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Together, these facilities help create a more complete environment for long-term business activity.<\\/span><\\/p><h2><span>Become Part of Green Alliance Enterprises<\\/span><\\/h2><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Green Alliance Enterprises is creating a new commercial destination for the fruit and vegetable trading community of Ahmedpur East.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Whether you are a <strong>wholesaler, commission agent, retailer, transporter, agricultural supplier or entrepreneur<\\/strong>, the market provides an opportunity to establish your business in a professionally planned environment.<\\/span><\\/p><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>With modern infrastructure, spacious trading areas and essential facilities available within the project, Green Alliance Enterprises aims to make wholesale trade more organized, accessible and business-friendly.<\\/span><\\/p><h3><span>Explore Commercial Opportunities Today<\\/span><\\/h3><p class=\\\"isSelectedEnd\\\"><span>Discover available shops and business opportunities at <strong>Green Alliance Enterprises<\\/strong> and become part of a growing wholesale trading destination in Ahmedpur East.<\\/span><\\/p><p><span><strong>Suggested Featured Image Alt Text:<\\/strong> Modern wholesale market facilities at Green Alliance Enterprises in Ahmedpur East<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"seo_meta\":{\"seo_title\":null,\"seo_description\":null,\"index\":\"index\"},\"seo_meta_image\":null,\"status\":\"published\",\"author_id\":\"1\",\"image\":\"gemini-generated-image-un4zh4un4zh4un4z.jpg\",\"tag\":null,\"submitter\":\"apply\"}', 'created', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/151.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', '127.0.0.1', '1', 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', '19', 'Inside Green Alliance Enterprises: 8 Facilities Built for Modern Wholesale Trade', 'info', '2026-08-16 15:59:05', '2026-08-16 15:59:05'),
